2	// The scene is rendered into a half-float MSAA target and resolved once; the composer's own buffers
3	// are single-sample HDR so bloom thresholds operate on true HDR values without repeated resolves.
4	// Tone-mapping and sRGB conversion happen once, in OutputPass.
